1
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:11,560
Prosecutor Xu,

2
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:14,000
how is my son doing?

3
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:15,450
He's doing fine.

4
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:16,780
We just went to see him.

5
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:18,100
We took a video for you.

6
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:28,840
Rest assured.

7
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:30,440
We'll make sure he's

8
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:31,800
well taken care of.

9
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:33,000
Thank you.

10
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:34,480
Thank you.

11
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:38,080
I never thought my moment of impulse

12
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:41,280
would lead to this.

13
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:44,040
My son has become the biggest victim.

14
00:00:45,080 --> 00:00:46,840
I regret it so much.

15
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:50,040
The court session is about to begin.

16
00:00:50,040 --> 00:00:51,240
Reform yourself well

17
00:00:51,360 --> 00:00:53,090
and try to return to him sooner.

18
00:00:55,120 --> 00:00:55,720
Thank

19
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:57,600
you.

20
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:02,520
Based on the basic facts of this case,

21
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:04,720
our sentencing recommendations
for the two defendants

22
00:01:04,720 --> 00:01:05,640
are as follows.

23
00:01:06,080 --> 00:01:07,480
Defendant Zhou Yumei's

24
00:01:07,680 --> 00:01:09,280
actions have violated...

25
00:01:09,280 --> 00:01:11,240
under Paragraph 2, Article 234

26
00:01:11,240 --> 00:01:14,160
of the Criminal Law
of the People's Republic of China,

27
00:01:14,160 --> 00:01:16,080
constituting the crime
of intentional injury.

28
00:01:16,080 --> 00:01:18,440
violating Paragraph 1, Article 310

29
00:01:18,440 --> 00:01:20,880
of the Criminal Law
of the People's Republic of China,

30
00:01:20,880 --> 00:01:22,240
constituting the crime of harboring.

31
00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:24,760
Under Paragraph 1, Article 69

32
00:01:24,760 --> 00:01:27,000
of the Criminal Law
of the People's Republic of China,

33
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,200
we recommend a sentence of 10 years
of fixed-term imprisonment

34
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:31,930
for the defendant, Xu Nianqiu.

35
00:01:32,039 --> 00:01:33,440
His behavior has violated

36
00:01:33,440 --> 00:01:35,240
Paragraph 2, Article 234 of

37
00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:37,880
the Criminal Law
of the People's Republic of China,

38
00:01:37,880 --> 00:01:40,539
constituting the crime
of intentional injury.

39
00:01:56,880 --> 00:01:58,340
Zhou Yawen, I'll kill you!

40
00:01:58,360 --> 00:01:59,800
Zhou Yawen, I'll kill you!

41
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:01,260
Zhou Yawen, I'll kill you!

42
00:02:01,600 --> 00:02:03,060
Zhou Yawen, I'll kill you!

43
00:02:03,080 --> 00:02:03,880
I'll kill you!

44
00:02:03,880 --> 00:02:04,600
Zhou Yawen!

45
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:07,360
Prosecutor,

46
00:02:08,440 --> 00:02:10,440
I've been reforming for nine years.

47
00:02:10,639 --> 00:02:11,560
What I regret most now

48
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:13,880
is the mistake I made back then.

49
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:16,760
I will definitely change when I get out.

50
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:19,410
Since you're getting out soon,

51
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:20,850
I'll say one more thing.

52
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:22,360
There aren't many things in life

53
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:24,040
you can regret.

54
00:02:24,480 --> 00:02:26,540
I hope you learn your lesson this time

55
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:29,090
and cherish a better tomorrow.

56
00:02:29,320 --> 00:02:30,320
After you get out,

57
00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:31,300
live a good life

58
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:32,680
and benefit society.

59
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:33,120
I will.

60
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:34,160
I will.

61
00:02:34,920 --> 00:02:35,520
Thank you.

62
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:37,720
Thank you.

63
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:42,000
Xu Yishan!

64
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:43,440
Yishan.

65
00:02:43,440 --> 00:02:44,720
Why are you here?

66
00:02:44,720 --> 00:02:44,960
Wait.

67
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:45,890
What's going on?

68
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:48,200
Jiang Yuan has been
on business trips a lot lately

69
00:02:48,200 --> 00:02:49,260
and is rarely home.

70
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:51,320
Chengcheng started boarding school today.

71
00:02:51,320 --> 00:02:52,480
So I'm always home alone.

72
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:53,160
It's pretty boring.

73
00:02:53,160 --> 00:02:55,200
I figured I'd just move next door to you.

74
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:55,680
Wait,

75
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:57,880
why didn't you tell us before moving in?

76
00:02:57,880 --> 00:02:59,280
I wanted to surprise you,

77
00:02:59,720 --> 00:03:00,760
but we bumped into each other.

78
00:03:00,760 --> 00:03:02,280
This is quite the surprise.

79
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:02,840
All right,

80
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:04,160
come help me move these.

81
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:04,490
Okay,

82
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:05,640
I'll take this one.

83
00:03:05,640 --> 00:03:06,570
Let's go inside.

84
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:07,840
Yishan,

85
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:09,440
you brought so much stuff.

86
00:03:09,880 --> 00:03:12,340
Are you planning to be
a permanent resident?

87
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:15,860
I was just worried it'd be inconvenient
if I forgot something.

88
00:03:16,079 --> 00:03:16,680
No,

89
00:03:18,160 --> 00:03:19,800
if you need anything later,

90
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:20,240
we

91
00:03:20,640 --> 00:03:22,000
can just bring it to you.

92
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:23,720
Did you really have to bring all this?

93
00:03:23,720 --> 00:03:25,180
Just find a place to put it.

94
00:03:25,600 --> 00:03:26,200
All right,

95
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:27,760
you guys stop unpacking.

96
00:03:28,160 --> 00:03:29,620
I'll do it myself tonight.

97
00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:31,050
Are you free?

98
00:03:31,600 --> 00:03:32,660
Let's grab dinner.

99
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:33,600
What are we eating?

100
00:03:33,600 --> 00:03:34,460
I want to go too.

101
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:36,079
Don't crash the party.

102
00:03:36,079 --> 00:03:38,540
Didn't you agree to play games
with Zhou Yan?

103
00:03:39,079 --> 00:03:40,240
How could I forget?

104
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:42,410
I shouldn't have promised him.

105
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:43,360
What's going on?

106
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,360
Just the two of us?

107
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:44,810
Yeah.

108
00:03:45,079 --> 00:03:46,140
Are we going or not?

109
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:47,730
Let's go.

110
00:03:49,079 --> 00:03:49,720
Sis,

111
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:51,360
I came

112
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:53,560
to see you.

113
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:56,400
Why are you so generous today?

114
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:57,320
I'm visiting my sister.

115
00:03:57,320 --> 00:03:58,720
Isn't it what I should do?

116
00:03:59,000 --> 00:03:59,560
Where's Weiwei?

117
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,620
Weiwei is not home.

118
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:02,340
Probably went out to play.

119
00:04:03,600 --> 00:04:04,530
How have you been

120
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:05,800
lately?

121
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,010
Pretty good.

122
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:08,640
Don't make small talk.

123
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:13,800
So here's the thing.

124
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:14,760
I actually

125
00:04:14,760 --> 00:04:16,290
have something to tell you,

126
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:17,450
but it's no big deal.

127
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:19,160
You know

128
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:21,519
I took Weiwei to Beitan
a while ago, right?

129
00:04:21,959 --> 00:04:23,890
It's a big city with so many people.

130
00:04:24,280 --> 00:04:26,120
I took my eyes off him for a second,

131
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:26,840
and Weiwei

132
00:04:27,200 --> 00:04:27,800
got lost.

133
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:29,280
Lost?

134
00:04:29,280 --> 00:04:29,880
No, no, no.

135
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:31,400
We found him right away.

136
00:04:31,400 --> 00:04:32,440
He's fine.

137
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:33,400
It's just that the park

138
00:04:33,400 --> 00:04:34,330
was too crowded,

139
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:36,480
and I had two kids with me.

140
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:36,810
I just

141
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:38,840
couldn't keep an eye on both.

142
00:04:39,159 --> 00:04:40,290
As long as he's fine.

143
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:42,760
I was wondering
why he's been acting weird lately.

144
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:44,220
I was just about to ask you.

145
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:47,300
How about this?

146
00:04:47,640 --> 00:04:49,570
Weiwei's school is starting soon.

147
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,680
I'll buy

148
00:04:51,320 --> 00:04:52,650
all his school supplies

149
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:54,159
as an apology to him.

150
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:57,520
Could you put in a good word for me?

151
00:04:57,520 --> 00:04:58,200
Alright.

152
00:04:59,080 --> 00:05:00,480
As long as the kid is fine.

153
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:01,920
It's not entirely your fault.

154
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:02,800
That park is crowded

155
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:03,480
and noisy.

156
00:05:04,760 --> 00:05:05,200
But

157
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:05,960
I have to say,

158
00:05:06,400 --> 00:05:07,880
stop being so careless all the time.

159
00:05:07,880 --> 00:05:08,480
I know.

160
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:09,520
You're so unreliable.

161
00:05:09,520 --> 00:05:11,120
My sister is the best.

162
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:13,960
Look at the nice weather.

163
00:05:13,960 --> 00:05:15,000
Let me take you out for a walk

164
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:16,400
and buy you some new clothes.

165
00:05:16,400 --> 00:05:17,460
Alright, alright.

166
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:18,600
You're just sweet-talking.

167
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:19,560
No,

168
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:20,520
I mean it.

169
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:24,210
You're always so good to me.

170
00:05:31,320 --> 00:05:32,200
Yishan,

171
00:05:32,760 --> 00:05:34,890
calling us out for dinner so suddenly,

172
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:36,760
is something up?

173
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,360
It's quite abrupt of me

174
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:39,620
to ask to see you today.

175
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:42,540
But I want to talk to you about Wei.

176
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:44,680
What is it?

177
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:52,960
There are some truths

178
00:05:53,760 --> 00:05:54,620
you should know

179
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:56,840
about Wei getting lost at 16.

180
00:05:59,080 --> 00:05:59,880
Aren't we eating?

181
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:01,210
Why bring this up again?

182
00:06:01,760 --> 00:06:02,360
It's such a small thing,

183
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:04,020
and you keep nagging about it.

184
00:06:05,320 --> 00:06:06,760
What are you doing?

185
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:08,880
What does this mean?

186
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:10,680
I feel like

187
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:12,560
you're implying something.

188
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:19,000
Ma'am,

189
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:21,280
to be exact,

190
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:23,930
she wasn't lost.

191
00:06:24,520 --> 00:06:26,780
It was a clear case of human trafficking.

192
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:27,360
Wei

193
00:06:27,640 --> 00:06:29,840
was sold by traffickers for 20,000 yuan

194
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:32,420
to a man in Shangwang Village as his wife.

195
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,460
You're talking nonsense!

196
00:06:35,159 --> 00:06:35,960
Fortunately,

197
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:37,480
she fought for her life to escape

198
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:38,540
and was found by us.

199
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:39,560
But if

200
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:42,200
things get worse,

201
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,800
who will bear the consequences?

202
00:06:54,960 --> 00:06:55,720
Zhang Qing,

203
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,440
you bastard!

204
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:02,080
What did you

205
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:03,600
tell me back then?

206
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:07,460
You said he was only lost
for a short while before you found him.

207
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,960
If Yishan hadn't told me,

208
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:11,080
were you going to lie to me forever?

209
00:07:11,080 --> 00:07:13,080
I'm so sorry.

210
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:15,480
I called the police

211
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:16,400
and looked for him.

212
00:07:16,400 --> 00:07:17,400
I was afraid you'd be mad

213
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:18,200
and yell at me.

214
00:07:20,960 --> 00:07:22,800
You should have told me!

215
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:24,320
He wasn't just lost.

216
00:07:24,320 --> 00:07:25,800
He was kidnapped!

217
00:07:29,280 --> 00:07:31,120
What exactly happened back then?

218
00:07:31,120 --> 00:07:31,980
I'm listening.

219
00:07:33,200 --> 00:07:33,800
Tell me.

220
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:35,360
Tell me.

221
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:37,440
We contacted her uncle

222
00:07:37,440 --> 00:07:38,520
using the phone number
provided by the victim.

223
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:39,560
He should be here any minute.

224
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:40,890
Let's wait a bit longer.

225
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:57,240
Little girl,

226
00:07:58,840 --> 00:08:00,240
when I'm in a bad mood,

227
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:01,500
I solve a Rubik's cube.

228
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:03,610
Watching it get solved side by side

229
00:08:04,440 --> 00:08:05,520
calms me down a lot.

230
00:08:06,320 --> 00:08:07,450
Want to give it a try?

231
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:13,920
Weiwei!

232
00:08:14,280 --> 00:08:15,440
Miss,

233
00:08:15,440 --> 00:08:16,280
you found her.

234
00:08:16,280 --> 00:08:16,740
Weiwei!

235
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,120
Are you Fang Wei's uncle?

236
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:18,880
Yes, I am.

237
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:19,720
Let me see.

238
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:20,720
Here is my ID card.

239
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:22,600
Thank you for finding the child.

240
00:08:23,320 --> 00:08:24,580
Please register here.

241
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:29,680
Thank you so much.

242
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:30,940
Sorry for the trouble.

243
00:08:31,080 --> 00:08:31,760
The child said

244
00:08:31,760 --> 00:08:33,620
you handed her over to strangers.

245
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:35,280
Yes.

246
00:08:35,760 --> 00:08:37,159
I was careless.

247
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:39,120
Didn't they say
they were taking photos of her?

248
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:40,720
I didn't... didn't pay attention.

249
00:08:40,720 --> 00:08:43,049
Did you know they were human traffickers?

250
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:45,680
The child was illegally
detained for two days.

251
00:08:46,040 --> 00:08:47,160
Human traffickers?

252
00:08:47,160 --> 00:08:47,720
Impossible.

253
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:50,080
They told me they were taking
some modeling photos of her.

254
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:53,120
Besides superficial wounds,
the child wasn't harmed otherwise.

255
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:54,280
Have you thought about
what the consequences

256
00:08:54,280 --> 00:08:55,210
could have been?

257
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:56,330
Oh my god.

258
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:57,640
I was careless.

259
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:58,280
I was negligent.

260
00:08:58,280 --> 00:08:58,920
Thank you.

261
00:08:58,920 --> 00:09:00,380
Thank you for finding her.

262
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:01,200
I was worried sick.

263
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:01,800
I've been looking for her too.

264
00:09:01,800 --> 00:09:02,730
Go see the child.

265
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:03,940
Weiwei,

266
00:09:04,400 --> 00:09:05,130
are you okay?

267
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:07,610
How did this happen?

268
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:08,850
Does it hurt?

269
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:09,800
My poor Weiwei.

270
00:09:09,800 --> 00:09:10,530
I am so sorry.

271
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:11,680
It's my fault.

272
00:09:11,880 --> 00:09:12,360
Please forgive me,

273
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:12,800
okay?

274
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,440
Don't be mad anymore.

275
00:09:15,160 --> 00:09:15,960
What's wrong?

276
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:18,000
Let me take a look.

277
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:21,640
Those bastards.

278
00:09:22,040 --> 00:09:23,500
How could they be so cruel?

279
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:24,600
When I find them,

280
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:25,460
I'll kill them.

281
00:09:26,640 --> 00:09:28,040
Can I ask you a favor?

282
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:30,720
When we get home later,

283
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:32,600
let's not tell Mom about this,

284
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:33,200
okay?

285
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:35,320
No,

286
00:09:35,680 --> 00:09:37,960
I'm just worried she might get sick again

287
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:40,080
if she gets too anxious,

288
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:40,800
right?

289
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:53,000
You bastard!

290
00:09:54,640 --> 00:09:56,480
That is my own daughter!

291
00:09:57,280 --> 00:09:59,720
Your own niece!

292
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:01,800
Are you even human?

293
